      387.02
    ],
    "text": "Clause 2: This clause amends section 442 of the Code of Criminal Procedure Act, No. 15 of1979 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) and the legal effect of the amendmentis to make provision to issue one certified copy of the judgment or final order of the record toeach of the parties to the case free of charge.",
