      256.91
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE CODE OF CRIMINAL PROCEDUREACT, NO. 15 OF 1979",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      273.17,
      401.88,
      298.31
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows: -",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      314.57,
      401.87,
      339.71
    ],
    "text": "1. This Act may be cited as the Code of CriminalProcedure (Amendment) Act, No. of 2022.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      355.97,
      401.89,
      408.71
    ],
    "text": "2. Section 442 of the Code of Criminal Procedure Act,No. 15 of 1979 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipalenactment\u201d) is hereby repealed and the following section issubstituted therefor: -",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      218.85,
      424.97,
      401.89,
      588.11
    ],
    "text": "442. If any person affected by a judgmentor final order of a criminal court desires tohave a copy of the judgment or the final orderor any deposition or other part of the record,he shall on applying for such copy, befurnished therewith by the court, uponpayment therefor, of a fee determined fromtime to time by the Secretary to the Ministryof the Minister assigned the subject ofJustice, by Notification published in theGazette, unless the court for some specialreason thinks fit to furnish it free of cost:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      218.85,
      604.37,
      401.88,
      670.91
    ],
    "text": "Provided however, the complainant andevery accused person of the respective caseshall be furnished with one certified copy each,of the judgment or final order of the record,free of cost.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      424.03,
      210.58,
      481.1
    ],
    "text": "\u201cCopies of ajudgment orfinal order orany deposi-tion or otherpart of record",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
